# ParaKöprü — elle deneme koleksiyonu (VS Code REST Client eklentisi)
# Sistem ayaktayken (docker compose up) her isteğin üstündeki "Send Request" ile çalıştırılır.
# Demo hesapların parolası .env'deki DEMO_PASSWORD'dır (varsayılan: ParaKopru.2026).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@password = ParaKopru.2026

### Sağlık kontrolü — kimlik doğrulaması gerekmez; veritabanı erişilemezse 503
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Tanımsız uç nokta — tutarlı hata biçimi: 404 {"error":{"code":"NOT_FOUND",...}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/olmayan-uc

### İstek kimliği — gönderilen X-Request-ID yanıtta aynen döner
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-Request-ID: deneme-12345

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kimlik doğrulama
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Giriş (operasyon uzmanı) — access token gövdede, refresh token pk_refresh çerezinde
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "operasyon@parakopru.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Oturumdaki kullanıcı ve izinleri — önce "Giriş" isteğini çalıştırın
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Token olmadan korunan uç — 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me

### Yanlış parola — 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "operasyon@parakopru.test", "password": "yanlis-parola"}

### Oturumu yenile — REST Client çerezi otomatik gönderir; yeni access token döner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Çıkış — refresh token iptal edilir, çerez silinir (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout

### Çıkıştan sonra yenileme — 401 SESSION_EXPIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Diğer demo hesaplarla giriş (rol: CUSTOMER, RISK_ANALYST, COMPLIANCE, AUDITOR, SYSTEM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "musteri@parakopru.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Denetim kaydı (izin: audit:read — yalnız uyum uzmanı ve denetçi)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Uyum uzmanı olarak giriş
# @name loginUyum
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "uyum@parakopru.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Denetim kaydı — 200, en yeni önce, sayfalı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit-log?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUyum.response.body.access_token}}

### Müşteri olarak giriş
# @name loginMusteri
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "musteri@parakopru.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Yetki ihlali: müşteri denetim kaydını göremez — 403 FORBIDDEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit-log
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Müşteri ve hesap yönetimi (F-1)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Operasyon uzmanı olarak giriş
# @name loginOps
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "operasyon@parakopru.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Müşteri aç (operasyon) — 201; aynı kimlik no ikinci kez → 409 CUSTOMER_EXISTS
# @name newCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"full_name": "Ayşe Yılmaz", "national_id": "{{$randomInt 30000000000 39999999999}}"}

### Vadeli EUR hesap aç (operasyon) — 201, IBAN otomatik
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id": "{{newCustomer.response.body.id}}", "kind": "TIME_DEPOSIT", "currency": "EUR", "maturity_date": "2027-06-30"}

### Vadesiz TRY hesap aç (operasyon)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id": "{{newCustomer.response.body.id}}", "kind": "CHECKING", "currency": "TRY"}

### Müşterinin hesapları (operasyon, süzgeçle)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts?customer_id={{newCustomer.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}

### Müşteriler listesi (operasyon)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}

### Demo müşteri kendi hesaplarını görür (vadesiz TRY/USD/EUR + vadeli TRY)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Yetki ihlali: müşteri hesap açamaz — 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id": "{{newCustomer.response.body.id}}", "kind": "CHECKING", "currency": "TRY"}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Çift taraflı defter (F-2, T-1, T-7)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Demo müşterinin hesapları — açılış bakiyeleri defterden gelir (vadesiz TRY 50.000,00 TL)
# @name myAccounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Hesap hareketleri (müşteri, kendi hesabı) — en yeni önce; balance_effect_minor: giriş +, çıkış −
# @name myEntries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/entries?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Yevmiye kaydı ve iki tarafı (operasyon; müşteri 403) — borç OPENING_EQUITY / alacak müşteri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/entries/{{myEntries.response.body.$.items[0].entry_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}

### Ters kayıt (operasyon) — 201; aynı Idempotency-Key ile tekrar → aynı yanıt + Idempotent-Replayed: true
# Not: demo bakiyesini sıfırlar; geri almak için `make reset-demo`.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/entries/{{myEntries.response.body.$.items[0].entry_id}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: ters-kayit-demo-1

{"reason": "Hatalı açılış bakiyesi"}

### Aynı kaydı yeni anahtarla tekrar ters çevirme — 409 ALREADY_REVERSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/entries/{{myEntries.response.body.$.items[0].entry_id}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"reason": "Hatalı açılış bakiyesi"}

### Idempotency-Key olmadan ters kayıt — 400 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/entries/{{myEntries.response.body.$.items[0].entry_id}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Anahtarsız"}

### Yetki ihlali: müşteri ters kayıt yapamaz — 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/entries/{{myEntries.response.body.$.items[0].entry_id}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"reason": "Yetkisiz"}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Transfer (F-3) ve defter değişmezleri (T-1)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Yeni müşteri hesabı (alıcı) — IBAN'ını bir sonraki isteklerde kullanır
# @name payee
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id": "{{newCustomer.response.body.id}}", "kind": "CHECKING", "currency": "TRY"}

### Banka içi havale (demo müşteri → alıcı) — 201 COMPLETED; aynı Idempotency-Key ile tekrar → aynı yanıt + Idempotent-Replayed: true
# @name sendMoney
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: havale-demo-1

{"from_account_id": "{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}", "to_iban": "{{payee.response.body.iban}}", "amount_minor": 25000, "currency": "TRY", "description": "Kira"}

### Yetersiz bakiye — 422 INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS (REJECTED transfer kaydı yazılır, X-Transfer-ID başlığında)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: havale-yetersiz-1

{"from_account_id": "{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}", "to_iban": "{{payee.response.body.iban}}", "amount_minor": 99999999999, "currency": "TRY"}

### Idempotency-Key olmadan — 400 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"from_account_id": "{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}", "to_iban": "{{payee.response.body.iban}}", "amount_minor": 100, "currency": "TRY"}

### Aynı anahtar, farklı tutar — 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: havale-demo-1

{"from_account_id": "{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}", "to_iban": "{{payee.response.body.iban}}", "amount_minor": 99, "currency": "TRY"}

### Başkasının hesabından gönderme — 403 (alıcının hesabı demo müşteriye ait değil)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"from_account_id": "{{payee.response.body.id}}", "to_iban": "{{payee.response.body.iban}}", "amount_minor": 100, "currency": "TRY"}

### Transfer ve durum geçmişi (CREATED → COMPLETED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers/{{sendMoney.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Transferlerim (müşteri yalnız kendininkini görür)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Defter değişmezleri (denetçi) — ok=true, her para biriminde sum_minor=0, summary_mismatches=0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/invariants
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}

### Yetki ihlali: müşteri değişmezleri göremez — 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/invariants
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dış banka transferi (F-3, T-2): ayırma → worker gönderir → banka sonucu → tamamlanır ya da ters kayıt
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Dış banka transferi (müşteri) — 202 RESERVED; birkaç saniye sonra COMPLETED (ya da belirsizlik → UNKNOWN → sorgu → COMPLETED/REVERSED)
# IBAN bankanın dışında: TR110099900000000000777777
# @name externalTransfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type": "FAST", "from_account_id": "{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}", "to_iban": "TR110099900000000000777777", "amount_minor": 5000, "currency": "TRY", "description": "Dış banka"}

### Dış transferin durumu ve geçmişi (RESERVED → SENT → COMPLETED / UNKNOWN / FAILED → REVERSED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers/{{externalTransfer.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Belirsiz (UNKNOWN) transferler (operasyon)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers?state=UNKNOWN
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}

### Sistem rolü olarak giriş (banka bildirimleri için)
# @name loginSistem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "sistem@parakopru.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Banka sonuç bildirimi (sistem) — çift gönderim sorun değil: 200, para bir kez hareket eder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/bank/transfer-status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSistem.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reference": "{{externalTransfer.response.body.id}}", "status": "COMPLETED", "amount_minor": 5000, "currency": "TRY"}

### Bankadan gelen transfer (sistem) — aynı reference tekrar gelirse duplicate: true
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/bank/incoming
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSistem.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reference": "banka-ref-0001", "beneficiary_iban": "{{payee.response.body.iban}}", "amount_minor": 12500, "currency": "TRY"}

### Yetki ihlali: operasyon banka bildirimi gönderemez — 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/bank/incoming
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reference": "x", "beneficiary_iban": "TR110099900000000000777777", "amount_minor": 1, "currency": "TRY"}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kart provizyonu, çekim, iade (F-4, T-3) — kart ağı çağrıları yalnız sistem rolünün
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Demo müşterinin kartı (müşteri) — maskeli numara
# @name myCards
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Kart provizyonu (kart ağı = sistem) — 201; 100,00 TL bloke olur, bakiye değişmez, kullanılabilir bakiye düşer
# @name authorize
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{myCards.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/authorizations
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSistem.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"amount_minor": 10000, "currency": "TRY", "merchant": "Kafe", "ttl_seconds": 600}

### Kısmi çekim (40,00 TL) — bakiye 40 TL düşer, blokenin kalanı 60 TL; hold ACTIVE
# @name capture1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/holds/{{authorize.response.body.id}}/captures
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSistem.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"amount_minor": 4000}

### Final çekim (30,00 TL) — kalan 30 TL serbest bırakılır; hold CAPTURED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/holds/{{authorize.response.body.id}}/captures
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSistem.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"amount_minor": 3000, "final": true}

### İade (10,00 TL) — çekilenden fazlası 422 REFUND_EXCEEDS_CAPTURE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures/{{capture1.response.body.capture.id}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSistem.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"amount_minor": 1000}

### Hesabın provizyonları (müşteri) — ACTIVE / CAPTURED / EXPIRED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/holds?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Yetki ihlali: müşteri provizyon açamaz — 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{myCards.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/authorizations
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"amount_minor": 100, "currency": "TRY"}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Zaman yolculuğu (T-7): as_of = geçerlilik zamanı, known_at = kayıt zamanı
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Denetçi olarak giriş
# @name loginDenetci
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "denetci@parakopru.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Güncel bakiye (müşteri kendi hesabını sorabilir)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Geçmiş bakiye: dün kapanışta (denetçi; müşteri as_of ile 403) — yalnız tarih = o günün sonu (UTC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/balance?as_of=2026-10-29
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDenetci.response.body.access_token}}

### Hem geçerlilik hem kayıt zamanı: "V anında bakiye, T anında bildiğimizle"
# Geriye tarihli bir düzeltmeden önceki ve sonraki known_at farklı bakiye verir (bkz. TESTING.md "Zaman yolculuğu")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/balance?as_of=2026-10-30T23:59:59Z&known_at=2026-10-30T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDenetci.response.body.access_token}}

### Defter hareketleri aralık ve kayıt zamanı ile (denetçi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/entries?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&known_at=2026-10-30T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDenetci.response.body.access_token}}

### Geriye tarihli düzeltme: açılış kaydını kendi geçerlilik zamanıyla ters çevir (effective_at = kaydın effective_at'i; operasyon)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ledger/entries/{{myEntries.response.body.$.items[0].entry_id}}/reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"reason": "Geriye tarihli düzeltme", "effective_at": "2026-10-30T00:00:00Z"}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dört göz onayı (T-7): 10.000 TL üzeri transfer ikinci bir yetkilinin onayını ister
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Uyum uzmanı olarak giriş (onaylayan)
# @name loginUyum
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "uyum@parakopru.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### 15.000,00 TL transfer (müşteri) — 202 PENDING_APPROVAL; para hareket etmez (eşik: 10.000,00 TL ÜZERİ)
# @name bigTransfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"from_account_id": "{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}", "to_iban": "{{payee.response.body.iban}}", "amount_minor": 1500000, "currency": "TRY", "description": "Büyük havale"}

### Onay bekleyenler (operasyon)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers?state=PENDING_APPROVAL
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}

### İsteyen kişi onaylayamaz (müşterinin onay yetkisi yok: 403 FORBIDDEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers/{{bigTransfer.response.body.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

### Onay (uyum uzmanı) — 200; transfer yürütülür (COMPLETED); ikinci onay 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers/{{bigTransfer.response.body.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUyum.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

### Reddetme (gerekçeli) — para hiç hareket etmez
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers/{{bigTransfer.response.body.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUyum.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"reason": "Şüpheli işlem"}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kur yönetimi ve çok para birimli transfer (F-5)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Güncel USD kurları (herkes okur) — en yeni geçerlilik önce
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fx/rates?base=USD
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Yeni USD kuru (operasyon) — rate metin; müşteri 403, geçersiz kur 400
# @name newRate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fx/rates
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"base": "USD", "rate": "41.2500"}

### Geçmiş kur: as_of anında geçerli kur (eskisi değişmez)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fx/rates?base=USD&as_of={{newRate.response.body.valid_from}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}

### Çok para birimli transfer: demo TRY hesabı → demo USD hesabı IBAN'ı (to_amount_minor, fx_rate kayda yazılır)
# Önce "Demo müşteri kendi hesaplarını görür" isteğiyle USD hesabının IBAN'ını alın.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"from_account_id": "{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[0].id}}", "to_iban": "{{myAccounts.response.body.$.items[1].iban}}", "amount_minor": 100000, "currency": "TRY", "description": "TL → USD"}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gün sonu: faiz tahakkuku ve stopaj (F-6, T-4)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Gün sonunu başlat (operasyon) — 202; aynı gün tekrar → 200 aynı çalıştırma (çift tahakkuk yok)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/eod/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"business_date": "2026-10-30"}

### Gün sonu durumu ve tahakkuk toplamları (brüt = net + stopaj)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/eod/runs/2026-10-30
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOps.response.body.access_token}}

### Yetki ihlali: müşteri gün sonu başlatamaz — 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/eod/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMusteri.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"business_date": "2026-10-30"}
